cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SphericalViewer in your research, please cite the software and identify the revision used."
type: software
title: "SphericalViewer: A MATLAB viewer for 360-degree VR images and videos"
authors:
  - family-names: Ban
    given-names: Hiroshi
    website: "https://github.com/hiroshiban"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB viewers for inspecting equirectangular 360-degree images and videos
  during visual psychology and neuroscience stimulus preparation. Standard
  MATLAB and optional Psychtoolbox/OpenGL renderers preview mono media or
  one eye of over-under and side-by-side stereo media on a desktop display.
keywords:
  - MATLAB
  - Psychtoolbox
  - virtual reality
  - 360-degree video
  - vision science
  - psychophysics
license: BSD-2-Clause
